ks等设计软件；熟练运用MAGMA、AnyCasting等压铸仿真软件进行工艺仿真优化；具备压铸各类缺陷系统性分析、专项改善攻关实战能力；熟悉新产品开发流程、整车生产启动（OTS/PVS/OS）流程。\n4. 综合能力：具备项目统筹、跨部门协调、技术方案评审能力；能带团队推进技术项目；能承受新项目试制、现场异常应急处理工作节奏。\n5. 优先项：有新能源汽车一体化压铸件开发经验、主机厂制造工程部门从业经历优先。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":"智界品牌事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":"本科","YearsOfWorking":null,"WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-13T10:35:24","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"b7b9053d-1517-4333-bd23-6bb22f910449","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561285120,"PostDateInt":1786588524000,"PostDate":"2026-08-13T10:35:24","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【智界汽车】制造中心-制造工程部（ME）-工艺体系主任工程师(J29189)","OrgId":3373122,"Org":"智界品牌事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 负责组织机物料年度降本预算编制、分解、执行监控与差异分析，统筹机物料试用管理。\n2. 牵头组织公司级工艺纪律稽查与落地监督，统筹异地