owExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"fc7fb69b-30c1-467f-8add-b8eecfcb00f6","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561282756,"PostDateInt":1786005964000,"PostDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【智界汽车】制造中心-智造工厂-生产调度岗(J32114)","OrgId":3373122,"Org":"智界品牌事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1. 监控焊装、涂装、总装三条产线实时产量，核对每班下线台数，产出达不到计划立刻找车间班组长整改。\n2. 对接生产计划员，处理临时插单、车型切换、设备停机、缺件停工等突发情况，现场协调调整排产。\n3. 跟进零部件配送，仓库、物流送料跟不上产线节奏时，同步催促，减少停工等待时间。\n4. 设备故障、工装损坏、人员缺岗导致停线，第一时间通知设备、工艺、人事到场处置，全程跟进恢复生产。\n5. 记录全天生产异常台账：停线时长、故障原因、损失台数，下班汇总调度日报上报生产主管。\n6. 管控车间在制品流转，防止工位堆料、堵线，保证各工序流转顺畅。\n7. 台风、检修、节假日前后，提前协调车间排班、物料储备，保障生产不断档。\n8. 同步成品整车入库进度，对接发运，平衡下线入库节奏。","Require":"1. 学历：大专及以上，机械、车辆、工业工程、物流相关专业优先。\n2. 经验：有整车/零部件工厂车间调度、现场班组长经验优先；应届生可接受储备调度。\n3. 技能：熟练Excel做数据台账；看得懂整车四大工艺流程；会操作SAP/MES生产系统加分。\n4. 综合能力：反应快，突发停线能快速多方协调；抗压能力强，车间两班倒需要轮班值守；对数字敏感，做事细心，能长时间在车间现场走动。\n5. 其他：沟通能力强，能同步车间、物流、设备、采购多个部门；能接受旺季加班、应急值守。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":"智界品牌事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"45aa3357-cb82-4cf2-8781-2f873ed4a19c","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561282755,"PostDateInt":1786005964000,"PostDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【智界汽车】制造中心-智造工厂-涂装工艺员(J32116)","OrgId":3373122,"Org":"智界品牌事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.工艺技术标准的制定和实施\n根据车间工艺技术质量目标及相关规定，及时受控并不断完善工艺文件，确保工艺符合率。协调组织各部门解决现场工艺及质量问题，建立并维护相关考核制度，并监督工艺的实施。\n2.推动现场工艺问题解决 \n根据车间生产质量的需要，通过对生产过程出现的工艺质量问题协调攻关解决；对新产品试制过程出现的工艺质量问题，配合研发单位、制造工程院进行解决；对售后反馈的工艺质量问题，配合制造质量部进行解决。\n3.工艺技术质量基础管理工作：\n根据公司计划与物流中心和制造质量部的要求，通过工艺纪律检查、质量数据统计等，结合整车制造部计划和要求，负责工艺技术计划、质量计划等相关计划的拟订，并负责技术资源的保障和落实。\n4.新产品技术、先进工艺知识的运用：\n根据公司及车间经营计划的要求，通过将新产品技术、先进工艺知识落实到现场工艺优化及新项目的规划工作中，实现技术的改进。\n5.质量体系维护建设：\n根据公司相关的质量体系管理制度和文件，在芜湖整车制造部领导和本部门领导的指导下，负责配合本部门的质量体系管理和质量体系的建设。组织人员建立质量信息库并统计、分析、存档，及时反馈、汇报必要信息，提高质量管理水平。\n6.供应商管理：\n对车间各供应商的技术服务人员进行管理和监督，规范供应商技术服务人员的工作方式和劳动纪律，提高其服务意识和服务质量，对材料产品出现的质量问题要及时进行分析，并要求供应商完成每日工作。","Require":"1. 学历专业：大专及以上，化工、材料、车辆、涂装相关专业，整车厂优先全日制本科。\n2. 工作经验：熟悉整车涂装全工序，可独立处理漆面缺陷；有产线爬坡、新车调试经验优先，应届生可培养。\n3. 专业能力：会使用色差仪、膜厚仪等检测工具；能编写SOP、8D报告，了解IATF16949体系，掌握MES系统基础操作。\n4. 现场适配：能驻涂装车间，接受两班倒，适应车间气味、噪音环境，熟悉危化品安全规范。\n5. 综合素养：观察力强，擅长跨班组、供应商协调；产线异常时可现场加班整改，抗压能力强。","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":"智界品牌事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount":0,"RepeatDeliverCount":0,"IsShowReward":false,"DetailAddress":null,"RewardText":null,"IsTop":false,"Cash":0,"CashText":null,"HideCash":false,"Score":0,"ScoreText":null,"HideScore":false,"HrDutyUser":null,"DutyUserId":0,"JobId":0,"RewardImgUrl":null,"RewardAttUrl":null,"RewardAttName":null,"JobAdNameWithoutJobCode":null,"Distance":null},{"Id":"8de6df02-719d-4c8a-964e-532605dedb3b","HeadCount":0,"JobAdId":561282753,"PostDateInt":1786005964000,"PostDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","EndTimeInt":0,"EndTime":"0001-01-01T00:00:00","JobAdName":"【智界汽车】制造中心-智造工厂-涂装体系员(J32117)","OrgId":3373122,"Org":"智界品牌事业部","Category":"社会招聘","CategoryId":"1","LocId":null,"LocNames":["安徽省·芜湖市"],"Salary":"面议","Duty":"1.质量体系搭建与运维管理\n负责涂装车间SQCDM五大质量体系（安全、质量、成本、交付、士气） 日常落地管控，根据公司年度质量目标，拆解车间体系指标并推进落地；编制、修订、更新涂装车间体系文件，包含作业指导书、工艺标准、缺陷判定标准、审核标准、整改流程文件，确保文件与现场生产一致、合规有效；维护车间质量体系台账、审核记录、整改记录、培训记录、设备点检记录，实现体系资料标准化、可追溯、可核查。 \n2.涂装制程质量缺陷管控：\n建立问题复盘机制，对批量质量事故、反复性缺陷开展根因分析，优化体系流程与作业标准。\n3. 体系审核与问题闭环管理\n负责涂装车间内部体系自查、日常巡检、专项审核，覆盖工艺执行、设备状态、人员操作、5S管理、质量记录、物料管控等维度；配合公司级、事业部级、客户级质量体系审核，提前梳理资料、排查现场问题，保障审核一次性通过 。\n4.工艺合规与标准化落地\n监督涂装全制程工艺执行，包含前处理、电泳、PVC密封、面漆、烘干、修饰、喷蜡等工序，确保全员严格按照体系标准作业。\n5.体系培训与团队赋能\n针对新员工、轮岗员工开展涂装质量体系、缺陷识别、作业标准、审核流程专项培训；监督班组体系落地执行，指导一线员工规范填写质量记录、点检记录、整改记录。\n6.数据统计与汇报工作：\n定期输出车间体系运行报告、质量数据分析报告、缺陷整改报告、审核工作总结；整理归档所有体系资料、审核资料、整改资料、培训资料，实现台账规范化管理。","Require":"1. 学历&工作年限\n机械、化工、车辆、质量管理类相关专业；本科3年/大专5年整车涂装车间体系、质量相关从业经验优先，熟悉IATF16949。\n2. 基础要求 \n身体健康，能长期驻涂装车间；严谨细致，原则性强，沟通协调能力好。\n 3. 专业知识\n① 吃透IATF16949、汽车行业质量国标、企业内部体系流程；\n②熟悉涂装前处理、电泳、喷涂全工艺流程、车间危化品、环保安全规范；\n③掌握内审、外审流程，了解8D、FMEA、PPAP、SPC、MSA五大工具。\n4. 实操工作能力\n①编制、更新车间SOP、控制计划、检验规范等全套体系文件；\n② 组织车间内部体系审核，跟进不符合项整改、闭环验证；\n③跟踪客户、第三方审核问题，输出整改报告、改善方案；\n④统计质量、体系台账，定期做体系运行复盘；\n⑤培训车间班组、工艺人员体系标准、质量要求。\n5. 软件技能\n熟练Office，会基础MES/质量系统，能看懂CAD图纸优先。\n6. 晋升方向\n质量主管、体系主管、车间质量负责人","ClassificationOne":null,"ClassificationTwo":"智界品牌事业部","Classification3":null,"Classification4":null,"Classification5":null,"Classification6":null,"FavoritesStatus":false,"Station":null,"Kind":"全职","Channel4IsHot":true,"Channel4IsLong":true,"Status":1,"Channel4HasReward":false,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendScore":null,"Channel4ExMicroRecommendReward":null,"Channel4RewardDescription":null,"IsCollect":false,"IsDelivered":false,"SubmissionLimit":null,"BelongStoreId":null,"Degree":null,"YearsOfWorking":"3年","WorkTime":null,"Insurance":null,"Welfare":null,"WorkWeChatQrCode":null,"Channel4IsAllowCampusRecommend":false,"Channel4CampusReward":null,"Channel4CampusScore":null,"Channel4CampusRewardDescription":null,"Channel4IsAllowExternalRecommend":false,"Channel4ExternalReward":null,"Channel4ExternalScore":null,"Channel4ExternalRewardDescription":null,"InnerChannelIsTop":true,"Channel4SequenceNumber":"","ChangeDate":"2026-08-06T16:46:04","JobVideoJd":null,"IsAllowRepeatDeliverSameJob":false,"AllowRepeatDeliverCount